    "directions": [
      "Dissolve kanten powder in water according to package instructions.!disolved kanten in a cooking pot and sugar added",
      "Pour the mixture into a shallow container and refrigerate until set.!Kanten dissolved and poured into a form",
      "Once set, cut the jelly into small cubes.!cutted into small cubes set kanten jelly on a chopping board with a small knife",
      "Mix shiratamako (glutinous rice flour) with water to form a dough.",
      "Roll the dough into small balls.",
      "Boil the dango in water until they float, then cool in ice water. See detailed recipe and instructions in this post.",
      "In a bowl, place a portion of the kanten jelly cubes.!kanten jelly cues arranged in a bottom of a serving bowl",
      "Add a scoop of sweet red bean paste.",
      "Arrange the shiratama dango and cut fruits in the bowl.!fresh fruits, shiratama dango, and sweet red bean paste arraged over the kanetn jelly",
      "If using, add a small scoop of matcha ice cream (to make cream anmitsu)."
    ],
